            "heading": "Overview",
            "image_content_width": 150,
            "content": "<p>If you thought our custom curtains couldn’t get any better, they just did. Introducing four new trim options, from timeless tassels to playful pom poms. </p><p>Try before you buy with our <a href=\"/products/sample-curtain-trim\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Trim Sample\">Trim Samples</a></p>",
